{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_fetching_data_in_an_effect", "label": "Fetching data in an effect", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fetching is the one You-Might-Not-Need case that survives as a legitimate effect, and react.dev still recommends something else."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_four_fetching_downsides", "label": "Four documented fetching-in-Effect downsides", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No server run so HTML is a spinner; structural waterfalls; no preload or cache; enough boilerplate that most codebases ship the buggy version."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_fetching_on_mount_is_weak", "label": "Fetching on mount is the weak strategy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The four downsides apply to fetching after mount in any library. Effects are just the most direct way to express it."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_network_waterfall", "label": "Network waterfall", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A child cannot render until its parent has, and an effect cannot run until its component has rendered, so requests serialize along tree depth."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_framework_or_cache", "label": "Framework fetching or a client cache", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A framework can start the request before render. TanStack Query, useSWR and React Router 6.4+ address cache and ergonomics but still fetch after mount."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_usedata_ergonomics_only", "label": "useData fixes ergonomics only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One race-condition guard instead of twenty. Still no cache, still after mount, still a waterfall and empty server HTML."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_setbio_null", "label": "Clear stale data before the next fetch", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "setBio(null) at the top of setup. Without it Alice's bio stays on screen labelled as Bob. Ignore prevents applying the wrong response; clearing prevents displaying it."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_fetching_data_in_an_effect", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_01_what_an_effect_is_for_react_dev_you_might_not_need_an_effect", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_fetching_data_in_an_effect", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_06_you_might_not_need_an_effect_readme_twelve_cases", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_four_fetching_downsides", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_network_waterfall", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_four_fetching_downsides", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_01_what_an_effect_is_for_effects_client_only", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_fetching_on_mount_is_weak", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_four_fetching_downsides", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_framework_or_cache", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_four_fetching_downsides", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_07_fetching_data_usedata_ergonomics_only", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_08_race_conditions_ignore_flag", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/07-fetching-data.md", "source_location": null, "weigh